cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "amber-cupotential: Whole-Step NVIDIA cuPotential Acceleration Patch for Amber24 pmemd.cuda_SPFP"
message: "If you use this integration patch in your research, please cite this repository along with Amber24 and NVIDIA cuPotential."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zhou
    given-names: Qingyang
repository-code: "https://github.com/zhouoh/amber-cupotential"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - molecular-dynamics
  - amber
  - pmemd
  - cupotential
  - cuda
  - cuda-graphs
abstract: >-
  Out-of-tree source patch and runtime bridge integrating NVIDIA cuPotential
  (PME nonbonded prolate/Ewald splitting and fused FP32 bonded tuples) with
  a pure-FP32 fltflt GPU integrator, analytical SETTLE, star-SHAKE/RATTLE,
  and multi-step CUDA Graph batching for Amber24 pmemd.cuda_SPFP.
